WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:15.020
Kyros, we are so disappointed. How could you? Didn’t we ask you to stay out of it? Didn’t we tell you that your pride will be the end of you?

2
00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:17.800
Look where your recklessness got you.

3
00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:21.300
My recklessness? Really?!

4
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:34.100
Amos, you are the wisest of us. You were the one I came to and asked to use the power of creators against the enemies who were tearing our allod apart.

5
00:00:35.180 --> 00:00:37.180
Listen to yourself, Kyros!

6
00:00:37.240 --> 00:00:40.840
This power was granted to us so we could create, not destroy!

7
00:00:40.840 --> 00:00:50.340
It was meant to be. And it was fate that sent immortal warriors to help us. Those who do not fear death. If you waited...

8
00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:56.320
Immortality is a poison that eats away at your souls!

9
00:00:56.320 --> 00:01:05.280
Look at yourself! You’re trembling! Shaking at the thought that your existence might end one day.

10
00:01:05.280 --> 00:01:12.280
And I’d give anything to go back and die in her place there... but I can’t.

11
00:01:12.740 --> 00:01:18.240
This is madness...! We are all grieving for Aellona. But trembling? Shaking?

12
00:01:21.840 --> 00:01:25.220
We do not fear death, but we do not invite it upon ourselves either, unlike you.

13
00:01:25.220 --> 00:01:30.720
You are not thinking clearly, Kyros. Aellona’s blood is on your hands, and I am forced to...

14
00:01:31.860 --> 00:01:34.860
Quiet!

15
00:01:35.500 --> 00:01:40.360
Blood on my hands... You’re right, my friend.

16
00:01:40.360 --> 00:01:46.360
I didn’t know why the creators made me like this - all I bring is death.

17
00:01:46.860 --> 00:01:56.360
I didn’t... until this morning. But now I know what my purpose is!

18
00:01:57.780 --> 00:02:03.280
I’ll take the blame for this blood and I’ll destroy this false immortality.

19
00:02:04.680 --> 00:02:09.680
Don’t even try to stop me!
